# ─── Waitlist (Web3Forms) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The waitlist modal posts signups to Web3Forms, which emails them to the
# founder inbox configured in the Web3Forms dashboard. The default access key
# is baked into src/lib/site.ts (it is a PUBLIC routing token — it ships in the
# client bundle and does NOT reveal the destination email), so the live site
# works with no extra configuration.
#
# You only need this file to ROTATE the key without editing source: copy it to
# .env.local (gitignored) and set the variable below, or set the same variable
# in your host's env settings (e.g. Vercel/Netlify → Environment Variables).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
